    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970413.0441\n\nSEOUL, April 14 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Kim Jong-Il promotes 123 generals, monitors say\n\n\n\n\nNorth Korean leader Kim Jong-Il has promoted 123 new generals in a move seen here as one of the final steps to pave the way for his formal assumption of power this year, monitors here said Monday.",
